title: With the interface hidden: go to file, the command palette, find, search and settings still work, and it comes back as it was
folders: rust-small
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left files
goto src/util.rs
wait 1200
mark before
wait 500
interface
wait 900
mark hidden
wait 500
quick util
wait 700
mark hidden-quick
wait 500
ui click 300 760
wait 400
palette fold
wait 700
mark hidden-palette
wait 500
ui click 300 760
wait 400
find double
wait 700
mark hidden-find
wait 500
find close
wait 300
left settings
wait 700
mark hidden-settings
wait 500
left settings:close
wait 300
search double
wait 1000
mark hidden-search
wait 500
interface
wait 900
mark back
wait 500
interface
wait 600
interface
wait 900
mark back-again
wait 500
quit
